Z||000000||elfiero||06-18-2001||08:28 AM||||Need some new sail panels for my car and I<BR>have a few questions:<BR>1.Are the ones at fiero warehouse as good as<BR>the originals?-I don't care about price as<BR>much as quality.<BR>2.they come "clear" and 20% tint-why not 10%?<BR>3.Can anyone reccomend any others to look at?<BR>any help or ideas you guys might have will<BR>help.||||reg||5
