Z||000002||stimpy||06-18-2001||08:53 AM||||If you want OE fit and finish and price is no object, why aren't you getting original equipment? Maybe I'm missing something. As for me, I have the same tinted panels as 1FST2M6, and I am very pleased with the fit and finish, and the tint is plenty dark for me. Plus, I think it is gong to be extremely difficult to find a better guy to deal with then Doug at FieroWarehouse.||||reg||1
Z||000003||elfiero||06-18-2001||09:06 AM||||I'm not saying I won't buy them from fiero<BR>warehouse,I just want to make sure I know<BR>about all my options.I like the 20% tint more<BR>than stock,but I would like 10% better than<BR>either!.I'm sure they are good people to deal<BR>with,as I have read many positive things<BR>about them!||||reg||6
Z||000004||stimpy||06-18-2001||02:34 PM||||Well, I can tell you that Fiero Heaven will take your money for a set, but I haven't ever heard a testimonial from someone who was happy with their tranaction. Fieroshop was selling these at a time, could be still. I wouldn't feel uncomfortable dealing with them, dispite the recent hoo-hah, but Doug offered a screaming deal to me on some seconds so I went with his. And ferrari-momo here on the forum offers fiberglass scoops to replace the panels. Theres some options.  Of course there is always the factory ones that will cost you double if you can find them. <P>My endorsement stays with Doug.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Monkeyman||06-18-2001||06:41 PM||||I just ordered a set from Doug.  You can't get 10% tint from him because he doesn't manufacture them with 10% tint.  The tint is in the panel, not added on like you would to your windows.  Also, his panels are made of (someone help me out here) something that's better than the original.  They'll bend in half before they'll break and they won't get that shattered look like the originals.  All this is info I've gotten from others and from Dougs website, not from personal experience (yet).  If I didn't think Dougs' panels were the best, I wouldn't have sent him my money.<P>MM||||reg||1
